1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:02,796
Patients waiting. Staff running. And
nothing ever changes.

2
00:00:02,796 --> 00:00:05,581
Every delay on your ward has a cause.

3
00:00:05,581 --> 00:00:07,670
What if you could prove it,

4
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:08,714
and fix it?

5
00:00:08,764 --> 00:00:13,492
Lean Six Sigma. Green Belt. Built for
healthcare practitioners.

6
00:00:13,542 --> 00:00:17,010
Thirty tools, across Define,
Measure, Analyse,

7
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,744
Improve, and Control.

8
00:00:18,794 --> 00:00:20,989
So we just work faster? No.

9
00:00:20,989 --> 00:00:23,183
Find the bottleneck. Speed up triage,

10
00:00:23,183 --> 00:00:25,744
and you only flood the waiting room.

11
00:00:25,794 --> 00:00:30,874
Map the whole patient journey, and the
waiting becomes impossible to ignore.

12
00:00:30,924 --> 00:00:34,656
Our sepsis antibiotics went from eighty
six minutes to fifty four.

13
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:38,049
And the run chart proves it
was a real shift,

14
00:00:38,049 --> 00:00:38,727
not luck.

15
00:00:38,777 --> 00:00:41,498
Which nurse is the weakest? None of them.

16
00:00:41,498 --> 00:00:45,238
The red bead ward shows the
differences come from the system.

17
00:00:45,288 --> 00:00:50,928
Thirty tools. Ten simulations. Over a
thousand exam practice items.

18
00:00:51,014 --> 00:00:53,322
Safety is not about perfect people.

19
00:00:53,322 --> 00:00:57,939
It is about defences that catch mistakes
before they reach the patient.

20
00:00:57,989 --> 00:01:00,545
Is that spike a real problem?

21
00:01:00,545 --> 00:01:02,675
The control chart tells you.

22
00:01:02,725 --> 00:01:04,872
Go and see the real work.

23
00:01:04,872 --> 00:01:07,735
Follow the process, never a
person to blame.

24
00:01:07,785 --> 00:01:10,377
Imagine never hunting for gloves again.

25
00:01:12,004 --> 00:01:13,864
And when you would rather play,

26
00:01:13,864 --> 00:01:16,654
two game worlds turn every
tool into a game.

27
00:01:16,704 --> 00:01:19,558
From Ford’s moving line in
nineteen thirteen,

28
00:01:19,558 --> 00:01:21,597
to the hospitals of today.

29
00:01:21,647 --> 00:01:26,772
Prepare for nine certification blueprints,
from Yellow Belt to Black Belt.

30
00:01:26,822 --> 00:01:29,966
And a certificate that shows
exactly what I learned.

31
00:01:31,041 --> 00:01:35,577
Stop firefighting. Start improving.
Open the toolkit today.

